    <summary>Live Windows taskbar speed meter with Network Lab, LAN IP scanner, Bufferbloat doctor, Gaming HUD v2, and Display controls.</summary>
    <description>NetSpeed Boss shows your real-time download and upload speed on the Windows taskbar alongside a full network lab, hardware monitor, and display controller.

### Features
- **Taskbar speed meter** auto-positioned in open space near the Windows 11 Weather bar (or freely draggable), dark/light adaptive, defaulting to bits (Mbps/Kbps) or bytes
- **Network Lab tab** with multi-stream Speedtest + history, **Bufferbloat &amp; Lag Doctor** (Grade A+ to F), **DNS benchmark**, **Wireless (Wi-Fi)** card + **Channel Congestion Analyzer**, **ISP Uptime &amp; Outage SLA logger**, and **LAN/ARP IP Scanner** with Trusted Device Watchdog &amp; Wake-on-LAN
- **Gaming HUD v2** with Card &amp; Horizontal Top-Strip modes, background-only transparency, 1% Low FPS, NVIDIA NVML + AMD ADL sensors, VRAM, RAG thresholds, and global hotkeys (`Ctrl+Shift+H/L/M`)
- **Displays tab** with native Win32 DDC/CI hardware Brightness/Contrast sliders, Refresh Rate (Hz), and Input Source switching across external and laptop monitors
- **Apps, Ports &amp; Firewall** with ETW per-app traffic, first-time app alerts, 1-click Windows Firewall block/unblock, and Listening Ports killer
- **Data usage &amp; per-Wi-Fi SSID caps** with click-a-date app breakdown and Excel-ready CSV exports</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/merchanthasan2/NetSpeedBoss/releases/tag/v1.4.0</releaseNotes>
